{"t": 1793317983110, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "obj_regress", "Objective 1 'Gather wood 10' counts wood currently held, so crafting sets it back: it read Wood 9/10 at tick ~760 (after 13 wood gathered), dropped to 6 then 5/10 after crafting a pickaxe and cooked meat. After crafting a second pickaxe (wood 5->2) the HUD still says Wood 5/10 while Inventory shows Wood: 2 - the bar neither tracks held wood nor total gathered. Expected: gathering progress that crafting does not undo."]}
